<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Turing wavenumber at 15.49 µm on Aulacopleura koninckii holaspis18 (428.3 Ma) (Aulacopleura koninckii_holaspis18)",
        "Turing wavenumber at 15.49 µm on Aulacopleura koninckii holaspis18 (428.3 Ma) faithfully reproduces Aulacopleura koninckii_holaspis18 morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Aulacopleura koninckii_holaspis18 specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
    schema:about "Aulacopleura koninckii_holaspis18" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Does not claim a measured holochroal lens diameter of 15.49 µm for this species.",
        "does_not_claim: Does not claim an independent second assessor.",
        "does_not_claim: Does not claim the geometric oval is a segmented cuticle outline.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian entries, diffusion ratio 40, and D_u solved so lambda_c = 15.49 µm (1.549e-05 m) at 428.3 Ma.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Mode counts 5, 11 and 14 repeats of 15.49 µm per pitch.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Rib-span fraction 0.2245 measured on the pinned photograph and applied to the 4.2 mm meraspis and 22 mm holaspis22 characteristic lengths.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Sixteen-mode Fourier fit to the photograph's axial rib profile (Pearson r = 0.9832).",
        "reported_in_source: Commons File:Aulacopleura konincki.jpg is a 14 mm Silurian specimen, CC BY-SA 3.0.",
        "reported_in_source: Fusco, Hong & Hughes 2016: axial growth gradients make trunk pitch non-uniform.",
        "reported_in_source: Hughes & Chapman 1995 and Fusco et al. 2004: Aulacopleura konincki adds thoracic segments through the meraspid period and holaspids vary in segment number, including an 18-segment morphotype.",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952: a reaction-diffusion instability selects a finite critical wavelength.",
        "transfer_boundary: The 15 µm carrier is painted at the photograph's resolved rib wavenumber; the photograph does not resolve a 15 µm lattice.",
        "transfer_boundary: The species_gallery meraspis, holaspis18 and holaspis22 JPEGs are byte-identical, so predecessor and successor pitches are not re-measured on separate fossils." ;
    pk:anatomicalStructure "Turing pigment stripe / ocellus wavelength in Aulacopleura koninckii_holaspis18 (Silurian (Wenlock Epoch, 428.3 Ma))" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "1. Chemical Turing / RD" ;
    pk:aristotelianMegistonGenos "II. Anaima (Invertebrata)" ;
    pk:aristotelianPoionForm "Stripes, Spots & Ocelli" ;
    pk:aristotelianPosonLaw "Turing Wavenumber k_c" ;
    pk:aristotelianSubalternClass "Entoma (Arthropoda)" ;
    pk:biologicalGenus "Aulacopleura" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0.py; output: docs/media/aulacopleura_koninckii_holaspis18_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png; organism: Aulacopleura koninckii_holaspis18; environment: n/a; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Hughes & Chapman 1995 and Fusco et al. 2004: Aulacopleura konincki adds thoracic segments through the meraspid period and holaspids vary in segment number, including an 18-segment morphotype. | Fusco, Hong & Hughes 2016: axial growth gradients make trunk pitch non-uniform. | Turing 1952: a reaction-diffusion instability selects a finite critical wavelength. | Commons File:Aulacopleura konincki.jpg is a 14 mm Silurian specimen, CC BY-SA 3.0.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian entries, diffusion ratio 40, and D_u solved so lambda_c = 15.49 µm (1.549e-05 m) at 428.3 Ma. | Rib-span fraction 0.2245 measured on the pinned photograph and applied to the 4.2 mm meraspis and 22 mm holaspis22 characteristic lengths. | Mode counts 5, 11 and 14 repeats of 15.49 µm per pitch. | Sixteen-mode Fourier fit to the photograph's axial rib profile (Pearson r = 0.9832).; transfer_boundary: The species_gallery meraspis, holaspis18 and holaspis22 JPEGs are byte-identical, so predecessor and successor pitches are not re-measured on separate fossils. | The 15 µm carrier is painted at the photograph's resolved rib wavenumber; the photograph does not resolve a 15 µm lattice.; does_not_claim: Does not claim a measured holochroal lens diameter of 15.49 µm for this species. | Does not claim the geometric oval is a segmented cuticle outline. | Does not claim an independent second assessor.]; phenomenon_size: 11 µm (1.088e-05 m, log10=-4.963 m, tier=4_cellular_10um); species_scale_ladder (10 runs from 11 µm to 2.4 cm): 11 µm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-bioelectric-polarity, 34 µm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-vertex-packing, 544 µm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength, 1.1 mm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-clock-wavefront, 2.4 mm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-morphogen-condensation, 3.0 mm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-elastic-buckling, 3.4 mm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-flux-canalization, 4.8 mm:aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-branching-tree" ;
